[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4201.99, "timestamp": "01:10:01", "text": "あなた自身ですか？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4204.63, "timestamp": "01:10:04", "text": "ああ、いい質問ですね。えっと、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4207.335, "timestamp": "01:10:07", "author": "@akamurajaizen", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/4TIH-D08DE7pk6l85RWWuj6VwP3lUitGX1m3JfDywIpryobVVVZSQqcm_MKVDuuN5keV4e0PSgU=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "LMAO"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4207.99, "timestamp": "01:10:07", "text": "うん、久しぶりだよね？私は思う、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4209.68, "timestamp": "01:10:09", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "sing?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4212.79, "timestamp": "01:10:12", "text": "えっと、コックのやつとかジョーンのとか色々やったよ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4214.55, "timestamp": "01:10:14", "text": "それは配信で、私は"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4217.177, "timestamp": "01:10:17", "author": "@zergrush78319", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nDwl-xtQg1-Z5v6Iv64Z42_Hei-15daYPmWXqoFR-4_b8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "sing to myself? like humming songs?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4217.99, "timestamp": "01:10:17", "text": "ひどく歌って、えっと、私は自分の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4219.99, "timestamp": "01:10:19", "text": "自分の言葉で。 「ああ、なんてことだ、それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4225.189, "timestamp": "01:10:25", "text": "「ちょっと恥ずかしすぎる」でも、まあ、そうですね、"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4227.737, "timestamp": "01:10:27", "author": "@zergrush78319", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_nDwl-xtQg1-Z5v6Iv64Z42_Hei-15daYPmWXqoFR-4_b8=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "i do all the time"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4229.99, "timestamp": "01:10:29", "text": "しばらく曲を聴いていなかったし、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4233.11, "timestamp": "01:10:33", "text": "えっと、自分のために歌ったんです。私は普段"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4234.79, "timestamp": "01:10:34", "text": "私が私の間にいる間に、私が私の間にいる間に"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4237.03, "timestamp": "01:10:37", "text": "私がシャワーを浴びている時とかに。私はただ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4238.015, "timestamp": "01:10:38", "author": "@prathampro", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/7tcieem4yOUd9YXALarR3aYDlD62vnZzUlT_1QVJKtQgVzXDOl8byGd1-8hfYZmHnjbZGyS_5Uw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "everyday"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4240.07, "timestamp": "01:10:40", "text": "目を閉じて歌ってみて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4242.79, "timestamp": "01:10:42", "text": "心の中のものを吐き出す、どんな感情でも。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4244.79, "timestamp": "01:10:44", "text": "毎日これらのメロディーが"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4245.95, "timestamp": "01:10:45", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "ah bathroom singer"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4247.59, "timestamp": "01:10:47", "text": "私が頭から取り出したいのは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4251.03, "timestamp": "01:10:51", "text": "いつか音楽の仕事を。でも私はこうも思う、「うん、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4254.95, "timestamp": "01:10:54", "text": "えっと、歌って歌うか、口笛を吹いてみます"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4259.11, "timestamp": "01:10:59", "text": "「それを出すんだ。」うん。だって、私が数年経ってから"}]